    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Look Behind You is short horror game about a young archeologist named Ari.\u00a0 She is given an opportunity to explore a recently discovered ruin buried under the desert sands.  The more you explore the ruin the less things make sense.  By the time you realize you shouldn't be there, it's already too late.\u00a0 Can you escape the danger you discover, or will you fall, and stay buried with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with RPGMaker XP, this game features simple graphics and simple controls, which are customizable by using the game properties.\u00a0 I also learned the hard way that the game will not go into full screen if you use certain resolutions on your display device, but that too is a simple change.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Look Behind You is short horror game about a young archeologist named Ari.\u00a0 She is given an opportunity to explore a recently discovered ruin buried under the desert sands.  The more you explore the ruin the less things make sense.  By the time you realize you shouldn't be there, it's already too late.\u00a0 Can you escape the danger you discover, or will you fall, and stay buried with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with RPGMaker XP, this game features simple graphics and simple controls, which are customizable by using the game properties.\u00a0 I also learned the hard way that the game will not go into full screen if you use certain resolutions on your display device, but that too is a simple change.</p>",
    "short_description": "Don't Look Behind You is a short, story-driven horror game made with RPGMaker XP. The controls are simple and customizable. Explore the ruin, enjoy the story, but above all else just remember... don't look behind you.",
